📖 Overview
The Blood Bank Management System is a web-based application designed to manage donor records, blood stock availability, and blood requests efficiently.
It provides a centralized platform for hospitals, donors, and receivers to track and manage blood donations and requests in real-time.
This system replaces manual records and ensures fast access to blood availability.

🚀 Features
👤 Donor Module
Register as a donor
Update donor profile
View available blood stock
Submit donation information

🏥 Admin Module
Manage donor database
Monitor blood stock levels
Approve / Reject blood requests
Maintain receiver records

🔥 System Features
Firebase Authentication
Firestore Database
Secure real-time data storage
Clean UI
Responsive dashboard

🛠 Tech Stack
Component	Technology
Frontend	HTML, CSS, JavaScript
Backend	Python Flask
Database	Firebase Firestore
Auth	Firebase Authentication
Hosting	Local OR Cloud

